# tally 2.1.7 S1 (#93): movements dated after E are never booked and flows counts them (E §2 Movements outside
# [S, E], E §4.1 step 3): a plan's instance with its amount, a decision's instance as a hole movement, HOLE-POSTRUN
# `after the run's end`, since its amount reads a walk that doesn't hold its day (L §8.1). Run 2026-01-01 ..
# 2026-06-30; pay and gift (plans, 100.00 PLN on day 10 of each month of 2026) and sweep (a decision on each month's
# end_of, so sweep[2026-06] falls on 2026-07-01) keeping 50.00 PLN in konto. f, g: flows of konto and savings past E
# hold sweep[2026-06] and sweep[2026-07], so the hole; w: flows of kasa over June .. August counts gift[2026-06..08],
# 300.00 PLN; p: flows of the plan pay in July, 100.00 PLN; sw: flows of the decision sweep in July, the hole; sw6:
# flows of sweep in June, inside the run, 100.00 PLN. Was (2.1.6): f 0.00, g 100.00, w 100.00, sw 0.00, the movements
# after E dropped in silence.
=== d3.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-18
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
index mon = month 2026-01..2026-12
input amt: money PLN
input dom: int
input keep: money PLN
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place kasa: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place savings: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

move pay[m in mon]: transfers
  on day_of(m, dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

move gift[m in mon]: transfers
  on day_of(m, dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to kasa amount amt

move sweep[m in mon]: transfers
  on end_of(m)
  at start_of(m)
  reads konto
  leg cash from konto to savings amount max(0 PLN, bal(konto) - keep)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  opening[konto] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[kasa] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[savings] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  dom = 10 "s"
  keep = 50.00 PLN "s"

ask f: flows(konto, 2026-06-01 .. 2026-08-31)
ask w: flows(kasa, 2026-06-01 .. 2026-08-31)
ask p: flows(pay, 2026-07-01 .. 2026-07-31)
ask sw: flows(sweep, 2026-07-01 .. 2026-07-31)
ask sw6: flows(sweep, 2026-06-01 .. 2026-06-30)
ask g: flows(savings, 2026-06-01 .. 2026-08-31)
=== expect
f: ?"after the run's end" (sweep[2026-06], sweep[2026-07])
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-02]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-03]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-04]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-05]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-06]
  unfulfilled: sweep[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: sweep[2026-02]
  unfulfilled: sweep[2026-03]
  unfulfilled: sweep[2026-04]
  unfulfilled: sweep[2026-05]
  left out: pay, 6 instances, first 2026-07-10
  cut 2026-10-18
g: ?"after the run's end" (sweep[2026-06], sweep[2026-07])
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-02]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-03]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-04]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-05]
  unfulfilled: sweep[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: sweep[2026-02]
  unfulfilled: sweep[2026-03]
  unfulfilled: sweep[2026-04]
  unfulfilled: sweep[2026-05]
  left out: pay, 6 instances, first 2026-07-10
  cut 2026-10-18
p: 100.00 PLN
  cut 2026-10-18
sw: ?"after the run's end" (sweep[2026-06])
  cut 2026-10-18
sw6: 100.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-02]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-03]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-04]
  unfulfilled: pay[2026-05]
  unfulfilled: sweep[2026-01]
  unfulfilled: sweep[2026-02]
  unfulfilled: sweep[2026-03]
  unfulfilled: sweep[2026-04]
  unfulfilled: sweep[2026-05]
  left out: pay, 6 instances, first 2026-07-10
  cut 2026-10-18
w: 300.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: gift[2026-06]
  cut 2026-10-18
